title: "guard-contractor-enforcement: federal enforcement actions against the largest U.S. guard contractors, from DOJ and EEOC press releases"
abstract: "Federal enforcement actions against the 48 largest recipients of U.S. federal guard-service contracts (FY2008-2026), hand-coded from Department of Justice and Equal Employment Opportunity Commission press releases (2009-2025), with a check of the SAM.gov exclusions list. Each action keeps its source link, the amount in the release's own words and what the release says about liability."
type: dataset
